Z||000030||afRaceR||07-24-2001||01:06 AM||||I had a similar problem with mine when I first got it. Checked and changed everything. Waterpump, multiple thermostats, both types of rad caps, themo cap, flushing, blah blah blah. Nothing worked. Burped the system so many times.<BR>One day, when water level was kind of low, I removed the radiator cap to watch water flow in the radiator. Very little movement. Pulled the radiator and had it check and sure enough, 30% was blocked. Had it cleaned reinstalled and now works perfectly.<BR>||||reg||1
